      "content": "The weight you are feeling is clearly immense, but please remember that children often feel a deep, intuitive bond with their parents that goes beyond daily struggles. Your effort to navigate life, even when it's hard, is part of the foundation for your child's life and resilience. Reaching out to a helpline or professional can help lift some of this weight so you can be present for your child in a healthier way. You deserve support too.",
      "source": "target",
